{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：Entra ID Protection风险检测。对应需求：构建块。官方：Entra ID Protection - Risk Detection。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-azure.identity_protection-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：Entra ID Protection风险检测","references":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/id-protection/concept-identity-protection-risks#risk-types-and-detection"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"da0d4bae-33ee-11f0-a59f-f661ea17fbcd","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 构建块","来源: 默认","对应需求: 构建块"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.dataset: \"azure.identity_protection\"\n","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"azure","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：Entra ID Protection风险检测\n\n### 为何重要\n作为关联或链式检测的前置信号\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","threat":[]}
